Changelog::kv
We need the ability to have more than one map and switch between them.

We might even want to be able to show more than one at a time.

We'll need to be able to copy paste between them.

Update
------

It was a slog, but now everything references an injected map instead of a global map,
and I can programmatically create alternate maps.

Update2
----

This basically works!

You can create multiple maps using the + map button and navigate between them by clicking
ont their button.

Objects go to the right map and the state is able to be saved.

We can only show 1 map at a time, but splitscreen will be a new issue.
